us="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA, SHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MITSUBISHI HEAVY INDUSTRIES, LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NOYAMA, HIDETO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HASHIZUME YOSHIHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA SHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NOYAMA HIDETO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASHIZUME, YOSHIHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA, SHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NOYAMA, HIDETO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An air mix damper device and a vehicle air conditioner capable of varying a discharge air temperature linearly according to the movement of a lever of an actuator, characterized in that rotating speed regulating mechanisms (60, 61) lowering the rotating speeds of a plate door type air mix damper (43A) at the times of initial opening (X) and final opening (Z) to below that at the time of intermediate opening (Y) are provided between the air mix damper (43A) opening and closing an air inlet surface (42a) of a heater core (42) and a rotating type lever (48) of an actuator (47) driving the air mix damper (43A).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention se rapporte à un dispositif amortisseur à mélange d'air et à un climatiseur de véhicule dans lesquels la température de l'air d'échappement peut varier linéairement en fonction du mouvement d'un levier d'actionneur. Ledit dispositif se caractérise en ce que des mécanismes de régulation (60, 61) de la vitesse de rotation sont disposés entre l'ouverture et la fermeture dudit amortisseur à mélange d'air (43A), lesdits mécanismes permettant d'abaisser, au moment de l'ouverture initiale (X) et de la fermeture finale (Z), la vitesse de rotation d'un amortisseur à mélange d'air (43A) de type à volet de commande en forme de plaque, à une valeur inférieure à la vitesse au moment de l'ouverture intermédiaire (Y), et une surface d'admission d'air (42a) du coeur d'un dispositif chauffant et un levier (48) d'actionneur (47), de type levier rotatif, assurant la commande dudit amortisseur à mélange d'air (43A).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>